  // cartridge from isoparts.py, the same objects FIG. 1 of the oil and gas page draws): a bench,
  // your records as a stack of ruled slabs at the back, the add-on as a cartridge on the bench in
  // front with Ping beside it (the flat mark it is everywhere), the console at the right with its
  // slot. Step 1: the cartridge is a ghost. Step 2: records run the way as comets, its lamp blinks,
